ll,"links":{},"attrs":[{"other":"#[attr = ConstStability {stability: PartialConstStability {level: Unstable {reason: None,\nissue: 143802, is_soft: false}, feature: \"const_ops\", promotable: false}}]"},{"other":"#[attr = Stability {stability: Stability {level: Stable {since: Version(RustcVersion {major: 1,\nminor: 0, patch: 0})}, feature: \"rust1\"}}]"}],"deprecation":null,"inner":{"impl":{"is_unsafe":false,"generics":{"params":[],"where_predicates":[]},"provided_trait_methods":[],"trait":{"path":"Shr","id":4650,"args":{"angle_bracketed":{"args":[{"type":{"primitive":"i8"}}],"constraints":[]}}},"for":{"borrowed_ref":{"lifetime":null,"is_mutable":false,"type":{"primitive":"u64"}}},"items":[18803,18804],"is_negative":false,"is_synthetic":false,"blanket_impl":null}}},"40603":{"id":40603,"crate_id":0,"name":"_mm256_mask_conj_pch","span":{"filename":"library\\core\\src\\..\\..\\stdarch\\crates\\core_arch\\src\\x86\\avx512fp16.rs","begin":[3991,1],"end":[3996,2]},"visibility":"public","docs":"Compute the complex conjugates of complex numbers in a, and store the results in dst using writemask k\n(the element is copied from src when corresponding mask bit is not set). Each complex number is composed of two\nadjacent half-precision (16-bit) floating-point elements, which defines the complex number `complex = vec.fp16[0] + i * vec.fp16[1]`,\nor the complex conjugate `conjugate = vec.fp16[0] - i * vec.fp16[1]`.\n\n[Intel's documentation](https://software.intel.com/sites/landingpage/IntrinsicsGuide/#text=_mm256_mask_conj_pch)","links":{},"attrs":[{"other":"#[attr = Stability {stability: Stability {level: Unstable {reason: None,\nissue: 127213, is_soft: false}, feature: \"stdarch_x86_avx512_f16\"}}]"},{"target_feature":{"enable":["avx512fp16","avx512vl"]}},{"other":"#[attr = Inline(Hint)]"}],"deprecation":null,"inner":{"function":{"sig":{"inputs":[["src",{"resolved_path":{"path":"__m256h","id":9313,"args":null}}],["k",{"resolved_path":{"path":"__mmask8","id":35780,"args":null}}