50787,"crate_id":0,"name":"strict_sub_signed","span":{"filename":"library\\core\\src\\num\\mod.rs","begin":[1269,5],"end":[1290,6]},"visibility":"public","docs":"Strict subtraction with a signed integer. Computes `self - rhs`,\npanicking if overflow occurred.\n\n# Panics\n\n## Overflow behavior\n\nThis function will always panic on overflow, regardless of whether overflow checks are enabled.\n\n# Examples\n\n```\nassert_eq!(3usize.strict_sub_signed(2), 1);\n```\n\nThe following panic because of overflow:\n\n```should_panic\nlet _ = 1usize.strict_sub_signed(2);\n```\n\n```should_panic\nlet _ = (usize::MAX).strict_sub_signed(-1);\n```","links":{},"attrs":[{"other":"#[attr = ConstStability {stability: PartialConstStability {level: Stable {since: Version(RustcVersion {major: 1,\nminor: 91, patch: 0})}, feature: \"strict_overflow_ops\", promotable: false}}]"},{"other":"#[attr = Stability {stability: Stability {level: Stable {since: Version(RustcVersion {major: 1,\nminor: 91, patch: 0})}, feature: \"strict_overflow_ops\"}}]"},{"other":"#[attr = Inline(Hint)]"},{"must_use":{"reason":"this returns the result of the operation, without modifying the original"}},{"other":"#[attr = TrackCaller]"}],"deprecation":null,"inner":{"function":{"sig":{"inputs":[["self",{"generic":"Self"}],["rhs",{"primitive":"isize"}]],"output":{"generic":"Self"},"is_c_variadic":false},"generics":{"params":[],"where_predicates":[]},"header":{"is_const":true,"is_unsafe":false,"is_async":false,"abi":"Rust"},"has_body":true}}},"11042":{"id":11042,"crate_id":0,"name":"Error","span":{"filename":"library\\core\\src\\convert\\num.rs","begin":[357,1],"end":[357,55]},"visibility":"default","docs":null,"links":{},"attrs":[],"deprecation":null,"inner":{"assoc_type":{"generics":{"params":[],"where_predicates":[]},"bounds":[],"type":{"resolved_path":{"path":"TryFromIntError","id":672,"args":null}}}}},"32840":{"id":32840,"crate_id":0,"name":"vreinterpretq_s64_u32","span":{"filename":"library\\core\\src\\..\\..\\stda